00:00:03.788 --> 00:00:05.580
STANLEY SHAW: The
frameworks in this course

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:09.120
will be helpful to anyone in a
digital health company whose work

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:11.790
touches the product or the customer.

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:15.900
And the insights can help health
system leaders evaluate and implement

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:17.520
digital solutions.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:21.180
So wherever you sit in the
digital health ecosystem,

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:24.840
this course will help you navigate
the needs of key stakeholders

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:28.860
like patients, doctors,
payers, and innovators

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:32.280
and how to leverage digital
tools to create value for them.

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:37.080
And you'll understand how the culture
and real-world practice of medicine

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:39.390
makes digital transformation
in health care

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:43.080
entirely different from
transformation of any other field.

